islik va texnologiyada kelajagingizni yarating\",\"admissions_description\":\"Buxoro davlat texnika universitetiga qo\\u2018shiling va ilg\\u2018or laboratoriyalar, sanoat hamkorligidagi o\\u2018quv dasturlari hamda xalqaro tan olingan diplomlarga ega bo\\u2018ling.\",\"admissions_button_label\":\"Onlayn ariza topshirish\",\"newsletter_title\":\"Bizning yangiliklarimiz\",\"newsletter_description\":\"Eng so\\u2018nggi yangiliklar, tadbir e\\u02bclonlari va akademik xabarlarni olish uchun obuna bo\\u2018ling.\",\"newsletter_placeholder\":\"Email manzilingiz\",\"newsletter_success_message\":\"Obunangiz uchun rahmat.\",\"useful_links_title\":\"Foydali havolalar\",\"faculties_title\":\"Fakultetlar\",\"contact_title\":\"Biz bilan bog\\u2018laning\",\"address_line_1\":\"Buxoro shahri, Murtazayev ko\\u2018chasi, 15\",\"address_line_2\":\"Buxoro viloyati, O\\u2018zbekiston Respublikasi\",\"phone_label\":\"Telefon:\",\"email_label\":\"Email:\",\"rights_text\":\"Barcha huquqlar himoyalangan BSTU \\u00a9 2026\",\"useful_link_labels\":{\"home\":\"Bosh sahifa\",\"about\":\"Biz haqimizda\",\"services\":\"Xizmatlar\",\"blog\":\"Blog\",\"contact\":\"Aloqa\"},\"faculty_link_labels\":{\"engineering\":\"Muhandislik fakulteti\",\"technology\":\"Texnologiya fakulteti\",\"natural\":\"Tabiiy resurslarni boshqarish fakulteti\",\"service\":\"Xizmat ko\\u2018rsatish va raqamlashtirish fakulteti\"},\"created_at\":\"2026-07-16T12:36:10.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:20:26.000000Z\"},{\"id\":3,\"web_footer_id\":1,\"locale\":\"ru\",\"logo_alt\":\"BSTU\",\"description\":\"\\u0411\\u0443\\u0445\\u0430\\u0440\\u0441\\u043a\\u0438\\u0439 \\u0433\\u043e\\u0441\\u0443\\u0434\\u0430\\u0440\\u0441\\u0442\\u0432\\u0435\\u043d\\u043d\\u044b\\u0439 \\u0442\\u0435\\u0445\\u043d\\u0438\\u0447\\u0435\\u0441\\u043a\\u0438\\u0439 \\u0443\\u043d\\u0438\\u0432\\u0435\\u0440\\u0441\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435\\u0442 (BSTU) \\u044f\\u0432\\u043b\\u044f\\u0435\\u0442\\u0441\\u044f \\u0432\\u0435\\u0434\\u0443\\u04