631\\u062f \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0648\\u0641\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0637\\u0627\\u0642\\u0629.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:00.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:00.000000Z\"},{\"id\":206,\"about_page_content_entry_id\":22,\"locale\":\"en\",\"value\":\"To secure a prominent position among the top 1,000 global universities in the QS World Rankings by 2030, establishing BSTU as Central Asia\'s primary research hub for industrial digitalization and energy-efficient resource management.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:01.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:01.000000Z\"},{\"id\":389,\"about_page_content_entry_id\":22,\"locale\":\"ru\",\"value\":\"\\u0412\\u043e\\u0439\\u0442\\u0438 \\u0432 \\u0442\\u043e\\u043f-1000 \\u043b\\u0443\\u0447\\u0448\\u0438\\u0445 \\u0443\\u043d\\u0438\\u0432\\u0435\\u0440\\u0441\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435\\u0442\\u043e\\u0432 \\u043c\\u0438\\u0440\\u0430 \\u0432 \\u043c\\u0435\\u0436\\u0434\\u0443\\u043d\\u0430\\u0440\\u043e\\u0434\\u043d\\u043e\\u043c \\u0440\\u0435\\u0439\\u0442\\u0438\\u043d\\u0433\\u0435 QS \\u043a 2030 \\u0433\\u043e\\u0434\\u0443 \\u0438 \\u0441\\u0442\\u0430\\u0442\\u044c \\u0433\\u043b\\u0430\\u0432\\u043d\\u044b\\u043c \\u0446\\u0435\\u043d\\u0442\\u0440\\u043e\\u043c \\u043f\\u0440\\u043e\\u043c\\u044b\\u0448\\u043b\\u0435\\u043d\\u043d\\u043e\\u0439 \\u0446\\u0438\\u0444\\u0440\\u043e\\u0432\\u0438\\u0437\\u0430\\u0446\\u0438\\u0438 \\u0432 \\u0426\\u0435\\u043d\\u0442\\u0440\\u0430\\u043b\\u044c\\u043d\\u043e\\u0439 \\u0410\\u0437\\u0438\\u0438.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:02.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:02.000000Z\"},{\"id\":573,\"about_page_content_entry_id\":22,\"locale\":\"uz\",\"value\":\"2030-yilga kelib QS xalqaro reytingida dunyoning eng kuchli 1000 ta universiteti qatoridan joy olish, Markaziy Osiyoda sanoat raqamlashtirish bo\'yicha yetakchi tadqiqot markaziga aylanish.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:03.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:4