44\\u0645\\u062a\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0627\\u0645\\u0639\\u0629\\u061f\",\"answer\":\"\\u062a\\u0623\\u0633\\u0633\\u062a \\u0645\\u062f\\u0631\\u0633\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0647\\u0646\\u062f\\u0633\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062a\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0639\\u0627\\u0648\\u0646 \\u0645\\u0639 \\u0634\\u0631\\u0643\\u0629 Uzbekneftegaz JSC\\u060c \\u0648\\u062a\\u0647\\u062f\\u0641 \\u0625\\u0644\\u0649 \\u062a\\u0632\\u0648\\u064a\\u062f \\u0637\\u0644\\u0627\\u0628 \\u0642\\u0637\\u0627\\u0639 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0627\\u0642\\u0629 \\u0628\\u062a\\u062f\\u0631\\u064a\\u0628 \\u0635\\u0646\\u0627\\u0639\\u064a \\u0639\\u0645\\u0644\\u064a \\u0639\\u0627\\u0644\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0642\\u0646\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0645\\u0633\\u0627\\u0631\\u0627\\u062a \\u0645\\u0647\\u0646\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0628\\u0627\\u0634\\u0631\\u0629.\"},{\"id\":5,\"question\":\"\\u0623\\u064a\\u0646 \\u064a\\u0642\\u0639 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0631\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0627\\u0645\\u0639\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0631\\u0626\\u064a\\u0633\\u064a\\u061f\",\"answer\":\"\\u064a\\u0642\\u0639 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0631\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0627\\u0645\\u0639\\u064a \\u0641\\u064a \\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u0639 \\u0645. \\u0645\\u0631\\u062a\\u0636\\u0627\\u064a\\u064a\\u0641 15\\u060c \\u0645\\u062f\\u064a\\u0646\\u0629 \\u0628\\u062e\\u0627\\u0631\\u0649\\u060c \\u0623\\u0648\\u0632\\u0628\\u0643\\u0633\\u062a\\u0627\\u0646.\"}]}},\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T18:41:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T18:41:33.000000Z\"}]}', '{\"id\":1,\"key\":\"main\",\"map_embed_url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps?q=Buxoro%20muhandislik-texnologiya%20instituti&t=&z=16&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed\",\"is_published\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T18:41:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T18:41:33.000000Z\",\"translations\":[{\"id\":1,\"contact_page_id\":1,\"locale\":\"en\",\"content\":{\"tag\":null,\"title\":\"Contact Us\",\"mapTitle\":\"Bukhara State Technical University Map\",\"cards\":[{\"kind\":\"address\",\"title\":\"Address\",\"details\":[\"15 Q. Murtazoyev Street\",\"Bukhara city, Uzbekistan\"]},{\"kind\":\"phone\",\"title\":\"Call Us\",\"details\":[\"+998 65 224 64 35\",\"+998 65 223 28 83\"]},{\"kind\":\"email\",\"title\":\"Email Us\",\"details\":[\"info@bstu.uz\",\"rector@bstu.uz\"]},{\"kind\":\"hours\",\"title\":\"Open Hours\",\"details\":[\"Monday - Saturday\",\"8:30 AM - 5:30 PM\"]}],\"form\":{\"nameLabel\":\"Your Name\",\"namePlaceholder\":\"John Doe\",\"emailLabel\":\"Your Email\",\"emailPlaceholder\":\"john@example.com\",\"subjectLabel\":\"Subject\",\"subjectPlaceholder\":\"Inquiry about services\",\"messageLabel\":\"Message\",\"messagePlaceholder\":\"Write your message here...\",\"sendingLabel\":\"Sending...\",\"sendLabel\":\"Send Message\",\"successMessage\":\"Your message has been sent successfully. Thank you!\",\"errorMessage\":\"We could not send your message. Please try again.\"},\"faq\":{\"tag\":\"FAQ\",\"title\":\"Answers to Your Frequently Asked Questions\",\"items\":[{\"id\":1,\"question\":\"When was Bukhara State Technical University (BSTU) established?\",\"answer\":\"BSTU was officially established in January 2025 by Presidential Resolution No. PP-22, uniting the Bukhara Engineering-Technological Institute and the Bukhara Institute of Natural Resources Management.\"},{\"id\":2,\"question\":\"What main faculties are available at BSTU?\",\"answer\":\"The university is structured into 4 faculties and 24 departments, including Chemical & Food Technologies, Oil & Gas Technology, Engineering & Construction, Power Engineering & ICT, Textile & Light Industry, and Natural Resources Management.\"},{\"id\":3,\"question\":\"Does BSTU offer joint or double-degree educational programs?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, BSTU offers double-degree and joint educational programs with leading technical universities in Latvia, Malaysia, Belarus, and Russia.\"},{\"id\":4,\"question\":\"What is the Advanced Engineering School at BSTU?\",\"answer\":\"Established in cooperation with Uzbekneftegaz JSC, the Advanced Engineering School provides energy sector students with hands-on, high-tech industrial training and direct career pathways.\"},{\"id\":5,\"question\":\"Where is the main university campus located?\",\"answer\":\"The university campus is located at 15 Q. Murtazoyev Street, Bukhara city, Uzbekistan.\"}]}},\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T18:41:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-23T09:02:26.000000Z\"},{\"id\":2,\"contact_page_id\":1,\"locale\":\"uz\",\"content\":{\"tag\":\"Aloqa\",\"title\":\"Biz bilan bog\\u2018laning\",\"mapTitle\":\"Buxoro davlat texnika universiteti xaritasi\",\"cards\":[{\"kind\":\"address\",\"title\":\"Manzil\",\"details\":[\"M. Murtazoyev ko\\u2018chasi, 15-uy\",\"Buxoro shahri, O\\u2018zbekiston\"]},{\"kind\":\"phone\",\"title\":\"Bizga qo\\u2018ng\\u2018iroq qiling\",\"details\":[\"+998 65 224 64 35\",\"+998 65 223 28 83\"]},{\"kind\":\"email\",\"title\":\"Bizga email yozing\",\"details\":[\"info@bstu.uz\",\"rector@bstu.uz\"]},{\"kind\":\"hours\",\"title\":\"Ish vaqti\",\"details\":[\"Dushanba - Shanba\",\"8:30 - 17:30\"]}],\"form\":{\"nameLabel\":\"Ismingiz\",\"namePlaceholder\":\"Ism Familiya\",\"emailLabel\":\"Email manzilingiz\",\"emailPlaceholder\":\"email@example.com\",\"subjectLabel\":\"Mavzu\",\"subjectPlaceholder\":\"Xizmatlar bo\\u2018yicha murojaat\",\"messageLabel\":\"Xabar\",\"messagePlaceholder\":\"Xabaringizni shu yerga yozing...\",\"sendingLabel\":\"Yuborilmoqda...\",\"sendLabel\":\"Xabar yuborish\",\"successMessage\":\"Xabaringiz muvaffaqiyatli yuborildi. Rahmat!\",\"errorMessage\":\"Xabarni yuborib bo\\u2018lmadi. Iltimos, qayta urinib ko\\u2018ring.\"},\"faq\":{\"tag\":\"Ko\\u2018p so\\u2018raladigan savollar\",\"title\":\"Sizni qiziqtirgan savollarga javoblar\",\"items\":[{\"id\":1,\"question\":\"Buxoro davlat texnika universiteti qachon tashkil etilgan?\",\"answer\":\"BuxDTU rasman 2025-yil yanvar oyida Prezidentning PP-22-sonli qarori bilan tashkil etilgan bo\\u2018lib, Buxoro muhandislik-texnologiya instituti va Buxoro tabiiy resurslarni boshqarish institutini birlashtirdi.\"},{\"id\":2,\"question\":\"BuxDTUda qanday asosiy fakultetlar mavjud?\",\"answer\":\"Universitet tarkibida 4 ta fakultet va 24 ta kafedra faoliyat ko\\u2018rsatmoqda, jumladan kimyoviy va oziq-ovqat texnologiyalari, neft va gaz texnologiyasi, muhandislik va qurilish, energetika va AKT, to\\u2018qimachilik va yengil sanoat hamda tabiiy resurslarni boshqarish.\"},{\"id\":3,\"question\":\"BuxDTU qo\\u2018shma yoki ikki diplomli dasturlarni taklif etadimi?\",\"answer\":\"Ha, BuxDTU Latviya, Malayziya, Belarus va Rossiyaning yetakchi texnik universitetlari bilan hamkorlikda qo\\u2018shma va ikki diplomli ta\\u2019lim dasturlarini taklif etadi.\"},{\"id\":4,\"question\":\"BuxDTUning Ilg\\u2018or muhandislik maktabi nima?\",\"answer\":\"Uzbekneftegaz AJ bilan hamkorlikda tashkil etilgan Ilg\\u2018or muhandislik maktabi energetika sohasi talabalari uchun amaliy, yuqori texnologiyali sanoat tayyorgarligi va bevosita kasbiy yo\\u2018nalishlarni taqdim etadi.\"},{\"id\":5,\"question\":\"Universitetning asosiy kampusi qayerda joylashgan?\",\"answer\":\"Universitet kampusi Buxoro shahri, M. Murtazoyev ko\\u2018chasi, 15-uyda joylashgan.\"}]}},\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T18:41:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T18:41:33.000000Z\"},{\"id\":3,\"contact_page_id\":1,\"locale\":\"ru\",\"content\":{\"tag\":\"\\u041a\\u043e\\u043d\\u0442\\u0430\\u043a\\u0442\\u044b\",\"title\":\"\\u0421\\u0432\\u044f\\u0436\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435\\u0441\\u044c \\u0441 \\u043d\\u0430\\u043c\\u0438\",\"mapTitle\":\"\\u041a\\u0430\\u0440\\u0442\\u0430 \\u0411\\u0443\\u0445\\u0430\\u0440\\u0441\\u043a\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u0433\\u043e\\u0441\\u0443\\u0434\\u0430\\u0440\\u0441\\u0442\\u0432\\u0435\\u043d\\u043d\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u0442\\u0435\\u0445\\u043d\\u0438\\u0