26-07-22T21:45:01.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:01.000000Z\",\"translations\":[{\"id\":158,\"about_page_content_entry_id\":158,\"locale\":\"ar\",\"value\":\"\\u0645\\u0646\\u0630 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0630\\u0648\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0648\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0643\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0642\\u0646\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0633\\u0627\\u0626\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0639\\u0627\\u0645 1959 \\u0648\\u0635\\u0648\\u0644\\u0627\\u064b \\u0644\\u062c\\u0627\\u0645\\u0639\\u0629 \\u062a\\u0642\\u0646\\u064a\\u0629 \\u062d\\u0643\\u0648\\u0645\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0642\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0631\\u0627\\u0626\\u062f\\u0629.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:01.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:01.000000Z\"},{\"id\":342,\"about_page_content_entry_id\":158,\"locale\":\"en\",\"value\":\"From our evening technical roots in 1959 to a fully autonomous, leading state technical university.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:02.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:02.000000Z\"},{\"id\":525,\"about_page_content_entry_id\":158,\"locale\":\"ru\",\"value\":\"\\u041e\\u0442 \\u0432\\u0435\\u0447\\u0435\\u0440\\u043d\\u0435\\u0433\\u043e \\u043e\\u0431\\u0449\\u0435\\u0442\\u0435\\u0445\\u043d\\u0438\\u0447\\u0435\\u0441\\u043a\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u0444\\u0430\\u043a\\u0443\\u043b\\u044c\\u0442\\u0435\\u0442\\u0430 \\u0432 1959 \\u0433\\u043e\\u0434\\u0443 \\u0434\\u043e \\u043d\\u0435\\u0437\\u0430\\u0432\\u0438\\u0441\\u0438\\u043c\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u0433\\u043e\\u0441\\u0443\\u0434\\u0430\\u0440\\u0441\\u0442\\u0432\\u0435\\u043d\\u043d\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u0442\\u0435\\u0445\\u043d\\u0438\\u0447\\u0435\\u0441\\u043a\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u0443\\u043d\\u0438\\u0432\\u0435\\u0440\\u0441\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435\\u0442\\u0430.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:03.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:03.000000Z\"},{\"id\":709,\"about_page_content_entry_id\":158,\"locale\":\"uz\",\"value\":\"1959-yildagi kechki texnika fakultetidan mustaqil yetakchi davlat texnika universitetigacha bo\'lgan yo\'l.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:04.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:04.000000Z\"}]},{\"id\":159,\"about_page_id\":1,\"path\":\"timeline.year1959Title\",\"value_type\":\"text\",\"sort_order\":158,\"is_active\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:01.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:01.000000Z\",\"translations\":[{\"id\":159,\"about_page_content_entry_id\":159,\"locale\":\"ar\",\"value\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0630\\u0648\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0642\\u0646\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0648\\u0644\\u0649\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:01.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:01.000000Z\"},{\"id\":343,\"about_page_content_entry_id\":159,\"locale\":\"en\",\"value\":\"Technical Roots\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:02.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:02.000000Z\"},{\"id\":526,\"about_page_content_entry_id\":159,\"locale\":\"ru\",\"value\":\"\\u0412\\u0435\\u0447\\u0435\\u0440\\u043d\\u0435\\u0435 \\u0442\\u0435\\u0445\\u043d\\u0438\\u0447\\u0435\\u0441\\u043a\\u043e\\u0435 \\u043e\\u0442\\u0434\\u0435\\u043b\\u0435\\u043d\\u0438\\u0435\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:03.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:03.000000Z\"},{\"id\":710,\"about_page_content_entry_id\":159,\"locale\":\"uz\",\"value\":\"Kechki ta\'lim asosi\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:04.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:04.000000Z\"}]},{\"id\":160,\"about_page_id\":1,\"path\":\"timeline.year1959Desc\",\"value_type\":\"text\",\"sort_order\":159,\"is_active\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:01.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:01.000000Z\",\"translations\":[{\"id\":160,\"about_page_content_entry_id\":160,\"locale\":\"ar\",\"value\":\"\\u062a\\u0623\\u0633\\u064a\\u0633 \\u0643\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0628\\u062e\\u0627\\u0631\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0642\\u0646