d gain access to advanced laboratories, industry-partnered curriculums, and globally recognized degrees.\",\"admissions_button_label\":\"Apply Online\",\"newsletter_title\":\"Our Newsletter\",\"newsletter_description\":\"Subscribe to receive the latest updates, event announcements, and academic news.\",\"newsletter_placeholder\":\"Your email address\",\"newsletter_success_message\":\"Thank you for subscribing.\",\"useful_links_title\":\"Useful Links\",\"faculties_title\":\"Faculties\",\"contact_title\":\"Contact Us\",\"address_line_1\":\"Bukhara city, Murtazaev street, 15\",\"address_line_2\":\"Bukhara region, Republic of Uzbekistan\",\"phone_label\":\"Phone:\",\"email_label\":\"Email:\",\"rights_text\":\"All Rights Reserved BSTU \\u00a9 2026\",\"useful_link_labels\":{\"home\":\"Home\",\"about\":\"About\",\"services\":\"Services\",\"blog\":\"Blog\",\"contact\":\"Contact\"},\"faculty_link_labels\":{\"engineering\":\"Faculty of Engineering\",\"technology\":\"Faculty of Technology\",\"natural\":\"Faculty of Natural Resources Management\",\"service\":\"Faculty of Service and Digitalization\"},\"created_at\":\"2026-07-16T12:36:10.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:20:26.000000Z\"},{\"id\":2,\"web_footer_id\":1,\"locale\":\"uz\",\"logo_alt\":\"BDTU\",\"description\":\"Buxoro davlat texnika universiteti (BSTU) Markaziy Osiyodagi yetakchi oliy ta\\u02bclim va ilmiy tadqiqot markazi bo\\u2018lib, muhandislik va raqamli texnologiyalar bo\\u2018yicha yuqori malakali mutaxassislar tayyorlaydi.\",\"admissions_badge\":\"2026\\/2027 qabul ochiq\",\"admissions_heading\":\"Muhandislik va texnologiyada kelajagingizni yarating\",\"admissions_description\":\"Buxoro davlat texnika universitetiga qo\\u2018shiling va ilg\\u2018or laboratoriyalar, sanoat hamkorligidagi o\\u2018quv dasturlari hamda xalqaro tan olingan diplomlarga ega bo\\u2018ling.\",\"admissions_button_label\":\"Onlayn ariza topshirish\",\"newsletter_title\":\"Bizning yangiliklarimiz\",\"newsletter_description\":\"En